   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5-tuple (States, Inputs, Outputs, update, initialState)\n\nStates       = {counting} × {0, …, M}\nInputs       = ({up, down} → {present, absent})\nOutputs      = ({count} → {0, …, M, absent})\ninitialState = (counting, c = 0)\nupdate((counting, c), i) =\n  (c + 1, count = c + 1)  if up ∧ ¬down ∧ c < M\n  (c − 1, count = c − 1)  if down ∧ ¬up ∧ c > 0\n  (c,     count = absent) otherwise",
   "originalText": "5-tuple (States, Inputs, Outputs, update, initialState)\n\nStates       = {counting} × {0, …, M}\nInputs       = ({up, down} → {present, absent})\nOutputs      = ({count} → {0, …, M, absent})\ninitialState = (counting, c = 0)\nupdate((counting, c), i) =\n  (c + 1, count = c + 1)  if up ∧ ¬down ∧ c < M\n  (c − 1, count = c − 1)  if down ∧ ¬up ∧ c > 0\n  (c,     count = absent) otherwise",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
